---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Notice | NYG International Investment';
const description = 'How NYG International Investment handles information submitted through this website.';
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell page-hero__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--inverse">Legal</p><h1>Privacy notice.</h1></div><p class="lede">A concise explanation of the information this website receives and how it is used.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="shell legal-copy">
      <p>Last updated: 18 September 2026.</p>
      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>NYG International Investment is responsible for the personal information voluntarily submitted through this website. Privacy enquiries may be sent to <a href="mailto:nyg@nyginvest.com">nyg@nyginvest.com</a>.</p>
      <h2>Information we receive</h2>
      <p>If you contact us, we receive the details you choose to provide, such as your name, work email, company and message. Our hosting and security providers may process limited technical information needed to deliver and protect the website.</p>
      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>We use contact information only to assess and respond to your enquiry, maintain necessary business records and protect the website from abuse. We do not use this website to make automated decisions about individuals.</p>
      <h2>Providers and international processing</h2>
      <p>The website is delivered through Cloudflare. Contact-form submissions are processed by Formspree. These providers may process information in jurisdictions outside your country under their contractual safeguards.</p>
      <h2>Retention and your choices</h2>
      <p>Enquiry information is retained only for as long as reasonably needed for the conversation, legal obligations and legitimate business records. You may ask for access, correction or deletion by emailing us. Applicable data-protection rights and regulatory remedies remain available to you.</p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>The public website does not set advertising or behavioural analytics cookies. Essential security and delivery mechanisms operated by the hosting provider may use limited technical storage where required.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this notice when the website, providers or legal requirements change. The date above identifies the current version.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
